      "content": "i dont want to rebuild anything. that's the thing. i used to have a Life. a real life with people who cared. now i just wake up and every single thing reminds me of how much i lost. it's like i'm just a ghost walking around a world that doesn't even want me. how am i supposed to just \"heal\" from literally having my entire existence erased?",
